@node Generating translation variants
@subsection Generating translation variants

@findex tlon-ai-translate
When you need to choose the best phrasing for a translated passage, the command @code{tlon-ai-translate} generates ten alternative Spanish translations of the text you provide. It prompts for the source text interactively, sends it to the AI along with the prompt in @code{tlon-ai-translate-variants-prompt}, and presents the alternatives in the minibuffer for selection. The chosen translation is copied to the kill ring.

@node Rewriting
@section Rewriting

@menu
* Generating rewrite variants::
@end menu

@node Generating rewrite variants
@subsection Generating rewrite variants

@findex tlon-ai-rewrite
The command @code{tlon-ai-rewrite} works similarly to @code{tlon-ai-translate} but operates on existing Spanish text. If a region is active, the region text is used; otherwise you are prompted for input. The AI produces ten variant rewrites, and the one you select is copied to the kill ring.

